  /// Resolution Job is scheduled but has not started yet. If you turn off the
  /// Identity Resolution feature in your domain, jobs in the PENDING state
  /// are deleted. PREPROCESSING : The Identity Resolution Job is loading your
  /// data. FIND_MATCHING : The Identity Resolution Job is using the machine
  /// learning model to identify profiles that belong to the same matching
  /// group. MERGING : The Identity Resolution Job is merging duplicate
  /// profiles. COMPLETED : The Identity Resolution Job completed
  /// successfully. PARTIAL_SUCCESS : There's a system error and not all of
  /// the data is merged. The Identity Resolution Job writes a message
  /// indicating the source of the problem. FAILED : The Identity Resolution
  /// Job did not merge any data. It writes a message indicating the source of
  /// the problem.
