  /// The format the timestamp field in your JSON object is specified. This
  /// value should be one of EPOCHMILLI (for Unix epoch timestamps with
  /// second/millisecond level precision) or ISO_8601 (following ISO_8601
  /// format with second/millisecond level precision, with an optional offset
